Package: libre-dt-lab
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, iso-codes
Recommends: graphicsmagick, dcraw, libimage-exiftool-perl, ghostscript, gnuplot
Description: virtual lighttable and darkroom for photographers
 Libre DT-Lab is an experimental fork of darktable. It manages digital
 negatives in a database and can show them through a zoomable lighttable.
 It also enables developing raw images and enhancing them.
 .
 This package contains the main application and the optional basecurve and
 noise profiling command line tools.
